  "notes": [
    "Spelling-change -AR verb: c→qu before e to preserve the hard /k/ sound (same pattern as Buscar, Tocar, Sacar)",
    "Affects yo pretérito indefinido (*practiqué*) and all subjuntivo presente forms (*practique, practiques, practique, practiquemos, practiquen*)",
    "All other tenses are fully regular",
    "Past participle: practicado (regular)",
    "*Practicar un deporte* = to play / do a sport: *Practica el tenis tres veces a la semana* = She plays tennis three times a week",
    "*Practicar un idioma* = to practise a language",
    "Related: la práctica (practice), práctico/a (practical), practicante (practising; practitioner)"
  ],
